  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/Arcdashckr/Effect-Icon-Plus/blob/main/images/title/effect_icon_plus_title_horizontal.png?raw=true\"> </br>\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/Arcdashckr/Effect-Icon-Plus/blob/main/images/display/effect_display_vanilla.png?raw=true\"> </br>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <strong>為狀態效果圖標添加彩色邊框</strong> </br>\n    <strong>帶來更鮮豔多彩的生動視覺效果</strong> </br> </br>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/Arcdashckr/Effect-Icon-Plus/blob/main/compatibility.md\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=%2300AF5C&label=Supported%20Mods&color=00753F&labelColor=black&query=$.supported_mods&url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Arcdashckr/Effect-Icon-Plus/main/tools/stats.json\" alt=\"支援模組\">\n    </a>\n    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/Arcdashckr/Effect-Icon-Plus/tree/main/assets\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?style=for-the-badge&logo=buffer&logoColor=white&label=Total%20Effect%20Icons&color=blue&labelColor=black&query=$.total_effect_icons&url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Arcdashckr/Effect-Icon-Plus/main/tools/stats.json\" alt=\"效果圖標總數\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <strong>從<a href=\"https://github.com/Arcdashckr/Effect-Icon-Plus/blob/main/compatibility.md\" target=\"_blank\">此處</a>查看模組相容性清單</strong> </br>\n    <strong>從<a href=\"https://github.com/Arcdashckr/Effect-Icon-Plus/issues/new?template=request-mod-support.yml\" target=\"_blank\">此處</a>提交模組相容性請求</strong> </br> </br>\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/Arcdashckr/Effect-Icon-Plus/blob/main/images/display/effect_display_mod.png?raw=true\"> </br>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    \n### <a href=\"https://github.com/Arcdashckr/Effect-Icon-Plus/blob/main/permission/\" target=\"_blank\">*</a>感謝 <a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/upgrade-effect-icon/\" target=\"_blank\">Upgrade Effect Icon</a> 作者 <a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/the_dark_side_of_rero/\" target=\"_blank\">CherryRero</a>\n\n</div>",
